				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Synchronize Element submodule for sandbox config fix and doc refresh\n\nUpdate the Element submodule from 08ff6e0f to b3e613ba, pulling in a critical fix for extension host startup and build system documentation improvements.\n\nKey modifications across components:\n- **Mountain**: Supply eight missing non-optional `INativeWindowConfiguration` fields (`perfMarks`, `loggers`, `colorScheme`, `mainPid`, `os`, `dataFolderName`, `sharedDataFolderName`, `version`) in `ConstructSandboxConfiguration`. Omitting these caused `TypeError` crashes during extension host initialization and workbench service construction.\n- **Maintain**: Rewrite the Mermaid architecture diagram in README.md with internal module subgraphs (Build CLI, Rhai scripting, Run logic), shell entrypoints, and build artifact classDefs. Fix a literal tab character in PlistEdit.rs replacing it with the escaped `\\t` byte.\n- **Cocoon**: Rebuild Target artifacts and synchronize RouteManifest timestamps — confirming build pipeline consistency with no source-level changes.\n\nThese changes prevent extension host startup crashes, improve build system documentation, and keep compiled artifacts aligned with source revisions.",
			"SHA": "9f3d23ed920cd1f1713ec94b1d134d28e44aec15"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
