			"Message": "chore(Project): Synchronize Element submodules for encryption and lifecycle optimizations\n\nUpdate the `Element` submodule from commit ab924b4a to ec5306a2 to integrate critical security and performance enhancements into the native backend.\n\nKey modifications in the Mountain component include:\n- **Encryption**: Implement `IEncryptionService` using AES-256-GCM (via the `ring` crate) with key derivation from hardware UUIDs, ensuring machine-specific secrets that persist across process restarts.\n- **Lifecycle**: Replace busy-wait polling loops with `tokio::sync::Notify` primitives in `LifecyclePhaseState`, eliminating 100ms startup latency and reducing CPU overhead.\n- **IPC**: Optimize `DecorationTypeLifecycle` notification handling by batching emissions per channel to minimize IPC overhead during high-frequency UI updates.\n\nThese changes align the native backend with VS Code's encryption semantics and significantly improve boot performance.",
			"SHA": "1966f393a619f77a192ca6e4c5e42a49cb50e034"
		}
